From: Ram Kumar Dwivedi <quic_rdwivedi@quicinc.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Aug 2024 11:36:10 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] ufs: Disable power mode change during hba probe

Disable power mode change during hba probe.

Change-Id: I8d0272580fb62fe76555a36b6beec7176a369d8f
Signed-off-by: Ram Kumar Dwivedi <quic_rdwivedi@quicinc.com>
---
 drivers/ufs/core/ufshcd.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/ufs/core/ufshcd.c b/drivers/ufs/core/ufshcd.c
index 60a1d6bfca9d..bd4df31b4cc3 100644
--- a/drivers/ufs/core/ufshcd.c
+++ b/drivers/ufs/core/ufshcd.c
@@ -8849,6 +8849,9 @@ static int ufshcd_device_init(struct ufs_hba *hba, bool init_dev_params)
 
 	ufshcd_set_timestamp_attr(hba);
 
+	dev_err(hba->dev, "%s: Power mode change disabled\n",__func__);
+	return 0;
+
 	/* Gear up to HS gear if supported */
 	if (hba->max_pwr_info.is_valid) {
 		/*
